[[The Battle Cats]] uses cats to attack and conquer the [[Enemy Bases|enemy bases]]. Some of these cats are obtained throughout the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]]. Others can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule/Gacha]], some even only appearing during certain events. Know which cats you will use and how to use them in order to achieve victory.
